        "created_at": "2015-07-20T20:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Partially correct!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You could say that about pretty much any guess that included at least one accurate requirement. &nbsp;Is it more correct than the other guesses?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>What if I said that</p>\n<div><div><div>\nFanatic deals killing blow to Apostate using radiant damage from Absolution while Undaunted is in play and Aegis, Prayer, and Fallen Angel have all been used?\n<div>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div>\n&nbsp;",
