        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-20T20:32:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>MigrantP wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Partially correct!\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYou could say that about pretty much any guess that included at least one accurate requirement. &nbsp;Is it more correct than the other guesses?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Indeed! It's more correct in some ways and less correct in other ways!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n<p>Fanatic deals killing blow to Apostate using radiant damage from Absolution while Undaunted is in play and Aegis, Prayer, and Fallen Angel have all been used?&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>How many hints do you guys want? I could give you lots of hints, or you could solve it on your own.</p>",
