        "cooked": "<p>I GOT HER! I FINALLY UNLOCKED REDEEMER FANATIC!</p><p>http://images.akamai.steamusercontent.com/ugc/442827692604527196/20C4F2C2083F26059ABD72C111ABF42F87F41937/</p><p>I AM NEVER FIGHTING APOSTATE AGAIN!</p><p>I'm almost positive that Reverend Pete has it right, 'Fanatic deals killing blow to Apostate using radiant damage from Absolution while Undaunted is in play and Aegis and Prayer have been used'.</p>",
