        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/riff.freelance/{size}/2050_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-21T04:16:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Finally got it!!!!</p><p>Legacy, Visionary, Haka, Fanatic, and Wraith in Atlantis</p><p>Ageis, Undaunted, Absolution</p><p>Ageis destroyed (by sucicide), replayed Ageis and Prayed. Next turn took out Apostate with Absoultion (radiant damage)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unsure direct requirements, but toughts:</p><p>Ageis must activate, Prayer after, Undaunted in play and final strike with Absolution. (Unsure if damage type matters, but source does.)</p>",
