        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-21T12:00:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>riff.freelance is correct. And thus t<span>he exact unlock condition has been discovered by the community. Some incorrect reports led people astray for quite some time, but the body of evidence became clear eventually!</span></p><p><b>Defeat Apostate with damage dealt by Fanatic using the power on “Absolution.” Undaunted must be in play. Prayer of Desperation must have been played at some time after Fanatic was restored by Aegis of Resurrection.</b></p>",
